cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata. To cite the version evaluated in
  the thesis, cite v0.8.0.
type: software
title: "Governed Agent Harness"
abstract: >-
  Local control plane that governs AI-assisted software development with nine normative phases,
  deny-by-default capabilities, shell-free validators, task-owned ChangeSets, hash-chained events,
  fail-closed gates and human decisions bound to the ChangeSet digest. Research artifact of a
  master's thesis.
authors:
